## How to use it

1. Copy the SCSS of this {{ entry.type }} and of every stylesheet dependency into your project, in the order listed under Dependencies, and compile them with your Spruce CSS setup.
2. Copy the HTML{% if entry.jsCode or entry.dependencies.scripts.length %}, and load the scripts with `defer` at the end of the `body`{% endif %}.
3. Replace the demo content (text, links, image URLs) in the HTML; keep the classes, the structure and the accessibility attributes.
